quities services. The Futures segment offers transaction services, including trading in VIX futures and other futures products, the licensing of proprietary market data, and access and capacity services. The Global FX segment provides institutional foreign exchange (FX) trading and non-deliverable forward FX transaction services. The company also provides trading solutions and products in multiple asset classes, including equities, derivatives, and FX across North America, Europe, and Asia Pacific. It has strategic relationships with S&P Dow Jones Indices, LLC; Frank Russell Company; and FTSE International Limited. The company was formerly known as CBOE Holdings, Inc. and changed its name to Cboe Global Markets, Inc. in October 2017. Cboe Global Markets, Inc. was founded in 1973 and is headquartered in Chicago, Illinois.","employees":1661,"website":"https://www.cboe.com","country":"United States","city":"Chicago","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Craig Steven Donohue","title":"CEO, President & Director"},{"name":"Ms. Jill M. Griebenow CPA","title":"Executive VP & CFO"},{"name":"Mr. Timothy  Lipscomb","title":"Executive VP & CTO"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":12.47,"tpe":14.12,"ps":3.244,"pfcf":17.59,"peg":1.305,"pb":2.391,"rev_growth":0.101,"eps_growth":0.1435,"eps_growth_fwd":0.1535,"eps_growth_next":0.1006,"div_yield":0.0173,"roe":0.1492,"roa":0.02526,"de":55.67,"gross_margin":0.3779,"op_margin":0.3191,"profit_margin":0.2302,"current_ratio":1.043},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":22.06,"sector":12.47,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":25.73,"sector":14.12,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":6.917,"sector":3.244,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":51.62,"sector":17.59,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":3.01,"sector":1.305,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":6.231,"sector":2.391,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"de","label":"Debt / Equity (%)","v":28